+(Curator Decision 0012 §1). Releases use one repository-wide tag
+`v<major>.<minor>.<patch>` that Curator's resolver consumes: all six
+packages are released together at one version, and per-package
+`<short>/v<major>.<minor>.<patch>` tags are not read by Curator.
+A context or MCP requirement selects a package within the repository
+through its `directory` field (for example
